rs, input.rs. Fully gated: PASS=61498 FAIL=0 FLAKY=22 XFAIL=1 (sorted_tables in aud_state_var, pre-existing), POSIX 54/657 against the C's 56/655 with the same two differentials, ptydiff 31/0, register 28/28."
